stateDiagram-v2
    state "Đã giao" as Assigned
    state "Đang tải" as Downloading
    state "Khởi động lại" as Rebooting
    state "Xác nhận" as Confirming
    state "Thành công" as Success
    state "Thất bại" as Failed
    state "Quay lui" as RolledBack

    [*] --> Assigned
    Assigned --> Downloading
    Downloading --> Rebooting: Ảnh firmware hợp lệ
    Downloading --> Failed: Lỗi tải hoặc hash
    Rebooting --> Confirming
    Confirming --> Success: Ứng dụng hợp lệ
    Confirming --> RolledBack: Lỗi xác nhận
    Success --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]